		{
			dependencies: ["331AA02E14F4EFDF"]
			description: [
				"\"A former beloved king of the Caverns, he ruled upon thousands. One day, everything changed. His lair was infiltrated by surface dwellers and was threatened for not giving up his people to the superior surface civilizations. He had declined, and when a war came, he built emergency exits in the catacombs, he was captured and executed quickly after, and his soul, combined with the rage of the other undead forces wanted revenge. They fused into one, a corpse of the king, with fury of the undead. They await miners to walk by and mercilessly slaughter them...\""
				""
				"Race - Skeleton"
				"Type - Necromantic"
				"Element - Blood"
				"Threat Level - 💀💀💀💀"
				"Summon - Use a \"Call forth the Dead King\" scroll found in Catacomb chests."
