		{
			dependencies: ["0ECB2EBB07620232"]
			description: [
				"\"The piglins captured something in the aftermath of the Great Nether Invasion, not a defender, just a creature that happened to be in the wrong place. They experimented on it with fire and metals, searching for reactions that never came. When it gave them nothing, they threw it into a deep lava pit to be rid of it. It did not die. The heat melted its form into a grotesque sludge of netherite and blackstone, cooling down and forming into something new. Now it sits motionless in a soul blacksmith structure, fused with lava and broken machines, too scared to move and too terrified to trust. It will attack anything that disturbs its stillness...\""
				""
				"Threat Level - 💀💀💀💀"
			]
