			dependencies: ["64C604010683712A"]
			description: [
				"\"This sealed structure of restless ghouls sits chained in the Sorrow Spires, forgotten, stuck in the flames of the Nether. Its creation followed after the End and Nether intertwined. This collapse also created the Blackstone Basin biomes. Not much is known about this creature, as its imprisoned still for centuries as of now. Only thing all know, is that its waiting for something, or someone, to end its suffering...\""
