		{
			dependencies: ["5C1B5B56C010D055"]
			description: [
				"\"This genetically modified Luxtrisaur was experimented on by Erebus. I believed in his ways. Some were rather concerning, and this one, no exception. After seeing what he's capable of, of this tyranny, this torture, I stopped his aid. Let him do his own, while I finish the work we started. After all, when I ascend, he will listen. Although the Tremorzilla was only experimental, its immense power proves that Erebus is flawless...\""
				""
				"Threat Level - ☠☠☠"
			]
