		{
			dependencies: ["7C52385E8FD4C8BD"]
			description: [
				"\"A powered apocalyptic murder weapon, filled with the energy of a null-star. It was created as a secret super-weapon, made to aid me and Erebus in the ordering. It's a cataclysmic abomination forged to destroy, annihilate, terrorize, and all of the above. Unlike the Tremorzilla, this experiment was tested for years. Always getting fixed, tweaked, and perfected to ensure its power is unleashed upon its full potential. It's terrifying of course, but only proves that we did only what we deemed to be necessary...\""
