			dependencies: ["7266894061BC1832"]
			description: [
				"\"Elementals are beings who harbor the world's capabilities. The Boulders harbor Earth, the Ents, nature, blazes and devils fire, and so on. However, they all have a source. The Ancient Elemental. This is the strongest elemental by far, controlling each and every element, and holds the world together. Upon its defeat, the world's order cracks once again, and you can continue to follow up to challange the Null-Star Abomination...\""
